# MeshDepthMaterial (WebGLShadowMap caster variant) - HAND-DERIVED, no capture: the browser run
# never compiled it (no such caster inside its shadow frustum). It is depth_inst_icol_back with
# the depth material's side DoubleSide (a DoubleSide caster without a map, e.g. the hotels'
# umbrellas), i.e. doubleSided instead of flipSided; three's parameters are otherwise identical.
name depth_inst_icol_dbl
lib depth
param shaderType MeshDepthMaterial
param shaderName
param instancing
param instancingColor
param vertexNormals
param doubleSided
param shadowMapEnabled
param shadowMapTypeDefine SHADOWMAP_TYPE_PCF
param opaque
param useDepthPacking
param depthPacking 3200
